OL,3,GNEWSASexual assault prompts warning
OL,4,Afrom police
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are urging the public to be
OL,7,Fvigilant after a woman was seriously
OL,8,Fsexually assaulted in Nottingham.
OL,10,FThe victim was attacked in Forest Road
OL,11,FWest, near Arboretum, at about 01:40
OL,12,FBST on Sunday.
OL,14,FThe suspect is described as a man in
OL,15,Fhis 20s or 30s with short black wavy
OL,16,Fhair, clean-shaven, about 5ft 6ins
OL,17,F(1.65m) tall, of a regular build and
OL,18,Fwearing a light-blue top with dark
OL,19,Ftrousers and trainers.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
